{
  "name": "repair_station",
  "space": "Blender coords: +Z up, front -Y, left +X; the origin is on the floor at the tile's centre. glTF/Godot: (x, z, -y). Hinges turn about their bones' local X (degrees), carriages slide along their bones' local Y (metres, + up), the shield bone scales along its local Y (up).",
  "rest": "stowed: the carriages parked high (the tools at 1.4 m), the arms folded along the towers (the left one pointing to the front, the right one to the back), the gripper closed; the shield at full size (the bind pose: hide it while the station is idle, or hold deactivate's last frame)",
