  "usage": "When the player stands on the pad: snap him to PlayerMount, show the shield and play activate (1 s, shield on: it grows out of its ring while the arms unfold and come down to him), then repair (5 s: the torch welds two seams over his front, the gripper grips and turns at his back; it ends where it starts, so loop it for a longer repair), then deactivate (1 s, shield off: the arms fold away while the shield sinks) and hide the shield. The shield blocks hits from activate to deactivate.",
